    {
      "id": "c65789dd-7a26-4a71-8c1d-20acf9aebbd6",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -20,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## SOC 2 Audit Log Pipeline\n\nCaptures AI interaction events as tamper-evident entries in Supabase. Returns a SHA-256 integrity hash per entry so integrity can be verified at any time.\n\n**Flow:** POST to webhook \u2192 validate fields \u2192 generate audit_id + SHA-256 hash \u2192 append-only INSERT to Supabase \u2192 return audit_id\n\n**SOC 2 TSC:** Supports evidence collection for CC7.2 (system monitoring) and CC9.2 (vendor and business partner risk).",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 1440,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6c3d1ede-ad4e-4f97-bbdb-f1884a323e11",
      "name": "Prerequisites",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -20,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Prerequisites\n\n1. Supabase project with `ai_audit_log` table\n   See README for the full SQL schema and RLS policy\n2. Header auth credential for the webhook API key\n3. Supabase anon key and service key",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9425ede2-4299-4b9d-9404-a4b62ed57ec3",
      "name": "Configuration",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        840,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Configuration\n\nIn **Write to Supabase**: replace:\n- `YOUR_SUPABASE_PROJECT_URL`\n- `YOUR_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`\n- `YOUR_SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY`\n\nIn **Receive Audit Event**: add your header auth credential.\n\nRetention window: 90 days. Change in the **Generate Audit Entry** Code node.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 1
      }
    }
  ],
